    website: "https://github.com"
title: "GNM-Craniofacial-Approximation-Pipeline: Blender add-on and offline fitting pipeline for supervised craniofacial approximation"
version: 5.0.0rc8
date-released: 2026-10-13
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23333535
repository-code: "https://github.com/GNM-Craniofacial-Approximation-Pipeline"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - "3d-skull"
  - "facial-approximation"
  - "forensics"
  - "gnm"
  - "blender-addon"
  - "statistical-shape-model"
  - "craniometry"
abstract: >-
  A Blender marker add-on and an offline, auditable fitting pipeline for
  supervised craniofacial approximation research. The pipeline fits a neutral
  GNM Head identity model to operator-defined skin targets derived from a
  scanned skull using Umeyama alignment, ridge regression with IRLS, and TPS
  correction. It features parallel dual viewports and explicit bone-versus-skin
  distance metrics designed for publication-grade reconstruction.
